#: templates/js/archive/_tourJS.html
msgid ""
"This section provides a real-time view of the specific steps documents "
"are actively going through right now."
msgstr ""
"Dieser Abschnitt bietet eine Echtzeit-Ansicht der spezifischen Schritte, "
"die Dokumente gerade aktiv durchlaufen."

#: templates/js/archive/_tourJS.html
msgid "Recent Activity"
msgstr "Aktuelle Aktivität"

#: templates/js/archive/_tourJS.html
msgid "Here you'll find a feed of the latest status changes for your documents."
msgstr ""
"Hier finden Sie einen Feed der neuesten Statusänderungen für Ihre "
"Dokumente."

#: templates/js/archive/_tourJS.html
msgid "Finish"
msgstr "Beenden"

#: templates/js/archive/_tourJS.html
msgid "Workitems Overview"
